  Mode: 91
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Chum
  Description: 'Anglers only - a timed feed on a reef. Shoals of prisms hang round the core. Paint a
    shoal and let go, and half your school is thrown at it and eats it, then the other half.
    Every omni crystal is one more creature, and a grazer held in your lure light joins you
    too. The most prisms taken off the board when the clock runs out wins. Higher
    intensities put the shoals farther out, under a shielded crust only Paint Shields
    cracks, with more wild grazers racing you for them.'
